<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-HERMIS BANK H1 NET PROFIT 14.35 MLN LITAS.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-HERMIS BANK H1 NET PROFIT 14.35 MLN LITAS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997</p>
<p>				   (million litas unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit					  14.35</p>
<p> Net interest income			     23.62</p>
<p> Commission and services income		13.49</p>
<p> Income from securities			  Nil</p>
<p> Income from forex operations		   4.21</p>
<p> Income from securities operations	    1.53</p>
<p> Loan loss provisions			     1.35</p>
<p> Operating expenses				21.22</p>
<p>Provisions for other off-balance sheet items</p>
<p>							  3.28</p>
<p> Depreciation and amortisation		  1.42</p>
<p> Assets					     741.61</p>
<p> Total deposits and letters of credit     493.27</p>
<p> Loans at net value			     361.63</p>
<p>NOTE - Second-largest private bank Hermis Bank did not</p>
<p>provide comparative figures for its first-half results.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 223 517</p>
</text>
